"4678","The Death Toll for February 2014","2014-03-02 10:57:00","Syria","** The Death Toll for February http://www.sn4hr.org/public_html/wp-content/pdf/english/The Death Toll for February.pdf
------------------------------------------------------------
The period covered by the report: February, 2014
The report includes:
* Civilians killed by the government forces.
* Rebels killed by the government forces.
* Civilians and rebels killed by the Islamic State of Iraq and Syria (ISIL).
* Civilians and rebels killed by the armed opposition.


** The report doesn’t include the death toll in the government forces since there are no specific criteria to be applied in such kind of documentation as the Syrian authorities ban and pursue the team of SNHR.
