------------------------------------------------------------


** الصفحة الرسمية لفريق عمل مكافحة شلل الأطفال (https://www.facebook.com/EndPolioInSyria)
------------------------------------------------------------
------------------------------------------------------------


**
------------------------------------------------------------


** After the success of the first round (achieving the coverage of 90%)
We glad to announce the launching of the second round of Polio vaccination
The Polio Task Force lunch of second round polio vaccination at 28 Jan 2014, which will go on for 6 days till the 2nd Feb 2014.
The vaccination work team will be working over vaccinate children (ages between 1 day - 5 years) within the area that they can reach, the H to H campaign will cover 7 provinces (Der-Alzour - Hasakeh - Raqqa - Aleppo - Idleb - Hama - Latakia).
The Polio vaccination Work team has started to prepare for the lynching of second round since the end of the first round which have a recordable success of fascinating around 1. 25 children within the liberated areas.
The Polio vaccination team issued the first round final report, of 82 pages includes the related figures, charts, and all the needed statistics, info, challenges that related to the campaign.
It is important to be mentioned that the polio vaccination campaign work team contain 8500 volunteers (with over than 200 doctors) distributed over 3500 teams.

