"4090","Press Release : Syrian Coalition welcomes the Kurdish National Coalition into its ranks","2013-11-13 15:19:00","Syria","Press Release
Syrian Coalition
Istanbul, Turkey
November 13, 2013

------------------------------------------------------------
The National Coalition of the Syrian Revolution and Opposition Forces is honored that the Kurdish National Council has joined the Syrian Coalition.

Both groups will continue the fight for freedom, dignity and justice sought by all components of Syrian society specifically those who have been victims of injustice and oppression from the tyrannical rule of the Assad Regime.

The marriage of these two groups is a large achievement which will promote national unity and inspire hope for the oppressed Syrian people in their struggle for a future democratic Syria.

We will build the future that they have long aspired to shape; a future shaped within a constitution that preserves the unity of the Syrian people and the integrity of Syrian territory.

Furthermore, this constitution aspires to meet the demands of all Syrians to live in harmony as well as to expedite the process of creating a fair democracy to match the sacrifices being made by the great Syrian people.
