"4045","بيان صحفي للوقوف على حيثيات اعتقال عدد من النازحين من المعضمية - Press Statement - From Starvation to Arbitrary Arrest&quot;","2013-11-08 11:42:00","jardin de GHE designe par moudar, Qudssaya Suburb, Syria","Dear all, Enclosed is:
Press Statement: An Urgent Appeal to Find Out the Merits of the Arrest of a
Number of Displaced People from the City of Mou&amp;#039;adamieh &quot;From Starvation to
Arbitrary Arrest&quot;

     *Violation Documentation Center  in Syria* has found out from many
sources that part of the sheltering center – an under construction
educational complex in Qudsaya Suburb in Damascus Countryside that had
received hundreds of people who were displaced from Mou&amp;#039;adamieh to Qudsaya
- has been transformed into an informal &quot; detention and interrogation
center&quot; for the Air Force Intelligence Branch and the Political Security
Branch( Al Jebeh Branch) as the center has begun receiving numbers of
displaced people after they were evacuated- under the auspices of Syrian
Arab Red Crescent- due to the heavy siege imposed by the regime&amp;#039;s army on the
residents of Mou&amp;#039;adamieh since 01-03 – 2013, which caused a great
human suffering
and the death of many children out of starvation.

     According to the same sources, the place is divided into two sections
for interrogation and detention: one for men and the other is for women
where hundreds of displaced people- estimated by 400 till now- have been
interrogated before some of them were released by the security authorities
responsible for the detention center, while many others are still under
arrest.



     Violation Documentation Center in Syria strongly condemns this
arbitrary arrest against the civilians who survived starvation in
Mou&amp;#039;adamieh, their illegal detention and the possibility of being subjected
to torture there. Accordingly, it calls on the International Committee of
the Red Cross and all humanitarian and relief organizations to shoulder
their responsibility, go into the merits of the matter, open an immediate
investigation , and claim the Syrian government an unconditional and
immediate release of the detainees, especially that transferring and
sheltering the displaced have been carried out in coordination with the
Syrian Arab Red Crescent , which was the primary coordinator for this
evacuation process .

Violation Documentation Center in Syria – *VDC*

November 2013

