and he maybe can&amp;#039;t  take his medicine regularly; besides, he is at risk of
torture and ill-treatment.

Eso was arrested in 3/9/2011 from his house in Al Hasakeh city by a patrol
of air force intelligence which is headed by Jameel Hasan.

Hasan Eso is a freelance writer works in a group of freelance Kurdish, Arab
and Christian scholars on development the Syrian civil society activities
and its diverse culture in order to create a mechanism of  knowledgeable
awareness for democratic modern pluralistic society.

