Enclosed is

Urgent Call from Aleppo Central Prison - Mesilmiya Village

     Abu Bara, one of the political prisoners from inside the Aleppo
central prison said to the Violations Documentation Center in Syria
that there are nearly 4500 prisoners and detainees in Aleppo central
prison living since one year in the worst humanitarian conditions,
especially since the beginning of this year where this tragedy has
greatly intensified in April 2013 where the battle of &quot;liberation of
prisoners&quot; started by the FSA army battalions, then the prison
administration&amp;#039;s responded to the battle in a promise to change the
title to &quot;burial of prisoners.&quot;
