--------------------------------------------------
A Lawyer&amp;#039;s life in dangerous

The Violations documentation center in Syria has come to know from a
private sources, that Lawyer and activist Mr.Mohammad Issam Zaglol - 35
Years old-, is being subjected severely tortured at the Air-force secret
police, Investigation division at the Mezzah military airport, due to
which he was transferred to a medical center, the same source has stated,
that the young lawyer&amp;#039;s facial features was drastically tarnished as a
result of the tremendous torture that he was exposed to, Mr.Mohammad was
transferred back to the same branch, The young lawyer has been arrested
for the second time in the 10th of October last year, in Damascus,
Al-razzi check point, as he was driving his car, and taken to a nearby
ranch, and asked his family for a huge ransom to release him, and upon the
family&amp;#039;s refusal to subject to their demands, they contacted a close
friend of him, who agreed to pay a ransom of five hundred thousand Syrian
pound to release his friend, and as he headed for the location that they
have chosen, he found agents of the secret police awaiting him, they took
the ransom and took them both to the air-force secret police branch.

it is worth mentioning that this is the activist&amp;#039;s second arrest, a father
of three kids, one of them was born while he was detained, as he was first
arrested on the 23rd of August, 2011 on the background of calling for a
sit-in on a satellite channel to claim for the release of detainees, in
addition to his writings and essays, his first detention period lasted for
five months, through which he was imprisoned at the detention center of
the air-force intelligence in Mezzah.

The violations Documentation center in Syria, urges all international and
local organizations to pressure the Syrian regime to reveal the fate and
whereabouts of Lawyer Zaglol.

And we hold the Syrian authorities the full responsibility for his safety.

