Urgent action: To reveal the  fate of Lawyer : Abdullah Al-khalil

Press Release:

Lawyer Abdullah Al-khalil , the head of the local council of AlRakka
Province has left the media&amp;#039;s center,located in Alkhraba Street, North of
the city- at midnight of 19th of may 2013, accompanied with Abo Mos&amp;#039;ab the
head of security&amp;#039;s office of the council, and with Abo manar , a member of
the security office, with a fourth person as well, they were all riding a
Mercedes car of the security&amp;#039;s office, heading to Al-moshalab district
located at the east side of the city, when a non-plate black car ( Brand :
Kia, Rio ) asked them to stop in front of the Immigration and passports&amp;#039;
building, the car had no signs or printouts on its body that would usually
reveal to which brigade or battalion it may be affiliated. The men in the
car asked them to show their ID&amp;#039;s, and upon searching the car, they
brandished their weapons, and Accused Mr.Khalil of being an alawite who
supports the regime, he tried in vain to explain that he is actually a
member of the local council, but the armed men never seemed to believe his
claim, and accordingly they arrested him, while his friend &quot;Abo Mos&amp;#039;ab&quot;
managed to run away, after being shot.



The armed men headed with Abdullah and his companions to the entrance of
the city, and upon stopping at a checkpoint affiliated to Al-Nosra&amp;#039;s
front, Abo manar managed to escape as well, after being shot by the armed
men who were in charge of the checkpoint, it is worth mentioning here,
that the Black car that has eventually kidnapped Mr.Abdullah, was keeping
him under surveillance since noontime of the same day.

Upon questioning a leader in Al-Nosra&amp;#039;s Front by Abo mos&amp;#039;ab the head of
council&amp;#039;s security&amp;#039;s office, the latter denied kidnapping Mr.Abdullah, and
said that their fighters stationed on that checkpoint, haven&amp;#039;t arrested
any of the armed men in the black car on that evening, it is worth
mentioning here that five armed and masked men were riding that car on
that evening.

we at the violations documentation center call for immediate disclosure on
the fate of Lawyer Abdullah Al-khalil and his companion who was kidnapped
as well, and we held the kidnapping entity-Regardless who they are- the
full responsibility of their Physical and mental well-being, and at the
same time we condemn any kidnapping act that would offends people&amp;#039;s
dignity and safety .

Source: The media office of the local council of the city of Rakka


