The student Asaad Mishaal fell martyr under torture

In a new crime committed by the security service, Young university&amp;#039;s
student &quot; Asa&amp;#039;ad Mesh&amp;#039;al&quot;, the 1991  born, of Alzahra&amp;#039;a neighborhood of
Homs has cited, after being tortured to death in a Military&amp;#039;s security
branch.

The young man was arrested 24 hours earlier in 19th of May 2013, on the
background of publishing this Facebook status : &quot; what about the right to
retaliate&quot;

Being a third year information technology student, Asa&amp;#039;ad was arrested on
his university&amp;#039;s campus, then was tken to the premises of the Military&amp;#039;s
security branch, where he was subjected to severe and systematic torture,
that eventually led to his death, five days later , security&amp;#039;s men have
contacted his family to hand them over his body

www.vdc-sy.info/index.php/en/details/martyrs/81189


